<title>INDIA: India's RBI lowers cut-off rate at repo auction.</title>
<headline>India's RBI lowers cut-off rate at repo auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it lowered the cut-off rate at Monday's repo auction to 4.22 percent from 4.75 percent at the last auction.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received 19 bids for 56.25 billion rupees of which it accepted two for 30.0 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off rate ws 4.2067 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
